<title>USA: American to hire 360 new flight attendants.</title>
<headline>American to hire 360 new flight attendants.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMR Corp's American Airlines said Monday it will hire about 360 new flight attendants this year and expects to continue hiring more in 1998 and 1999.</p>
<p>&quot;While we are still formulating our plans for the next two years, we expect a need for additional flight attendants to accommodate growth and normal attrition,&quot; said Mike Gunn, American's senior vice president of marketing.</p>
<p>American did not return calls seeking comment on the current number of flight attendants.</p>
